# What a client wears to use this fleet — the Outfit you would have on your
# laptop. It is the only Outfit in this example: the nodes hold none, and run
# whatever a start request tells them to.
#
# Note the missing BASEURL. The whole point is that outfit picks a node and
# fills the address in; an Outfit that states one is taken at its word and
# never routed.
PROVIDER llamacpp
MODEL    org/fake-model
ALIAS    fake-model
CONTEXT  4096
FLEET    ../fleet.yaml
